  "Name": "Commander: World 1",
  "Overview": "Mankind has swarmed out all over the universe, but is now attacked by aliens throwing asteroids at the Earth and its colonies.\n\nCommander: World 1 is an 8-bit-inspired tower-defense game. The player is a commander and must set up mercenaries, who can shoot the asteroids, on each planet. These asteroids come in waves and travel a path marked as a white dotted line. During the course of the level, these paths can be changed, while the planets are moving as well. Destroying asteroids earns money, which is used to upgrade the different classes of mercenaries.",
